n I roll it back? A change that's hidden behind a flag and easy to roll back needs far less scrutiny than one that can't be undone.","params":{"title":"Three questions before you review","style":"num","items":[{"text":"What must not change?","at":"must not change"},{"text":"How bad is it if this goes wrong?","at":"how bad"},{"text":"Can I roll it back?","sub":"flags and easy rollbacks cut review time","at":"roll it back"}]},"start":85.278,"dur":16.832,"words":[{"text":"To","s":85.578,"e":85.738},{"text":"set","s":85.818,"e":85.978},{"text":"the","s":86.058,"e":86.138},{"text":"depth,","s":86.218,"e":86.778},{"text":"he","s":86.858,"e":86.938},{"text":"asks","s":87.138,"e":87.338},{"text":"three","s":87.418,"e":87.578},{"text":"questions.","s":87.658,"e":88.298},{"text":"What","s":88.858,"e":89.018},{"text":"must","s":89.098,"e":89.338},{"text":"not","s":89.418,"e":89.658},{"text":"change?","s":89.738,"e":90.418},{"text":"How","s":90.698,"e":90.858},{"text":"bad","s":91.018,"e":91.178},{"text":"is","s":91.258,"e":91.338},{"text":"it","s":91.418,"e":91.498},{"text":"if","s":91.578,"e":91.658},{"text":"this","s":91.738,"e":91.818},{"text":"goes","s":91.898,"e":92.058},{"text":"wrong?","s":92.138,"e":92.858},{"text":"And","s":93.018,"e":93.178},{"text":"can","s":93.578,"e":93.658},{"text":"I","s":93.738,"e":93.818},{"text":"roll","s":93.898,"e":93.978},{"text":"it","s":94.058,"e":94.138},{"text":"back?","s":94.218,"e":94.818},{"text":"A","s":95.098,"e":95.178},{"text":"change","s":95.258,"e":95.578},{"text":"that's","s":95.658,"e":95.818},{"text":"hidden","s":95.938,"e":96.058},{"text":"behind","s":96.138,"e":96.298},{"text":"a","s":96.378,"e":96.458},{"text":"flag","s":96.538,"e":96.938},{"text":"and","s":97.058,"e":97.178},{"text":"easy","s":97.258,"e":97.498},{"text":"to","s":97.538,"e":97.578},{"text":"roll","s":97.658,"e":97.818},{"text":"back","s":97.898,"e":98.218},{"text":"needs","s":98.298,"e":98.618},{"text":"far","s":98.698,"e":98.938},{"text":"less","s":99.0